From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Seungmin Kim <8457324+ehfd@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 20:42:51 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Do not request lint, docs and upload tools at build time

setup_requires lists setuptools-lint, sphinx and twine, which are only
used for the lint, build_sphinx and upload commands. Building the wheel
does not need them (or six), and setuptools would otherwise try to fetch
them when they are missing from the build environment.
---
 setup.py | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/setup.py b/setup.py
index ec68b4e..2b45781 100644
--- a/setup.py
+++ b/setup.py
@@ -92,7 +92,6 @@ setuptools.setup(
     long_description=README + '\n\n' + CHANGES,
 
     install_requires=RUNTIME_PACKAGES,
-    setup_requires=RUNTIME_PACKAGES + SETUP_PACKAGES,
     extras_require=EXTRA_PACKAGES,
 
     author=INFO['author'],
